usage: run_lean_closure_archive.py [-h] --archive ARCHIVE --tool TOOL
                                   --cpu-library CPU_LIBRARY --ptx PTX
                                   --out OUT

Run a changed CUDA checker on every retained independently checked real graph.
Development/error analysis only: source frontend outcomes come from the
original whole acquisition. This cannot measure complete candidate
verification speed.

options:
